Error [E0970]: `find` can't read the directory `<TMP>/modeval-find-missing/./nope`
  --> env.jet:3:14
    |
  3 |     imports: find("./nope")
    |              ^^^^
 Why: `imports: find("<dir>")` walks that directory for `.jet` modules (U4); it must exist relative to this file
 Fix: create the directory, or fix the path so it points at your modules folder
